cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fastcheck: exact one-pass FASTQ quality control"
abstract: "Every FastQC question answered exactly, in one pass: per-position base/N/quality matrices, per-read length/GC/mean-Q histograms, duplication levels, polyX run lengths, over-represented sequences, k-mer content — no sampling, no hidden thresholds, no verdicts."
